the shabby  civilian clothes long sideburns and a  hairdo that seems to screw toward  unkempt mane instead of elaborately  styled points exposed claws and splashes  of red on the face indicate that this  version of wolverine has recently been  in conflict and the expression on his  face makes clear that he's ready for  more it's a design that's already  attracted plenty of attention from fans  and drawn comparison between isaacs and  wolverine's comic book look while fit  isaac is somewhat shorter and stockier  compared to hugh jackman which makes him  much closer in stature to how logan is  portrayed in the comics he appears  smaller yet more battle hardened than  jackman's finally muscled weapon x  though still very clearly played by a  handsome hollywood star this version of  wolverine comes across as somewhat less  glamorous as if he spent more time  fighting than working on his six-pack  moon knight which saw him step into the  title role as a hero whose power comes  from an egyptian god proves that isaac  has versatility and intensity to spare  with the right haircut in an adequately  impressive sideburn game there's every  reason to believe that the actor would  rock the role of marvel's favorite  claude newton it's also pretty safe to  say that fans would likely love to see  isaac as wolverine what's even better  though is the fact that isaac has made  multiple comments about how much he  likes wolverine in march 2022 the actor  told fandom that wolverine and  apocalypse were his favorite x-men  characters when he was young an  intriguing comment since he's already  managed to cross playing one of them  from his bucket list he also noted that  he loved wolverine in part because in  the comics he's a short superhero  something isaac himself could relate to  speaking to esquire around the same time  isaac again commented on feeling a  connection with wolverine noting  wolverine's a little guy in the comics  at least he was you know furry and angry  and i could relate to that between the  revelation that isaac likes wolverine  and the fact that he'd clearly fit the  role very well it's easy to get excited  about the prospect of him joining the  x-men as their grumpiest member of  course as astute fans might notice there  are some significant hurdles between  reality and this fun piece of fan  casting isaac's stint as apocalypse was  prosthetic heavy and very very blue so  it wouldn't necessarily disqualify him  from another x-men role however thanks  to professor charles xavier's appearance  in doctor strange in the multiverse of  madness marvel's mutants are inching  ever closer to the marvel cinematic  universe where isaac already embodies  the many personalities of moon knight  still if all else fails maybe the mcu  will one day adapt the comic book  storyline where wolverine becomes one of  moon knight's alternate personalities it  would be a nice way to kill two birds  with one stone check out one of our  newest videos right here plus even more  looper videos about marvel stars are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

